.
.  Create a GIF file for a 4-plot plot
.
DEVICE 1 X11
DEVICE 2 POSTSCRIPT
PRE-ERASE OFF
.
TITLE SIZE 8
TITLE DISPLACEMENT 2
LABEL CASE ASIS
X3LABEL AUTOMATIC
LABEL SIZE 7
TIC LABEL SIZE 7
X3LABEL DISPLACEMENT 12
THICKNESS 0.2
TIC OFFSET UNITS SCREEN
TIC OFFSET 1 1
.
echo on
.
skip 25
read PONTIUS.DAT y x
.
major xtic mark number 4
linear fit y x
. 6-plot y x
multiplot 2 3
multiplot corner coordinates 0 0 100 100
frame corner coordinates 24 20 94 90
.
line bl solid
char x blank
.
major ytic mark number 4
tic offset units data
ytic offset 0 0
xtic offset 1000000 1000
xlimits 1000000 3000000
major xtic mark number 2
.
plot y pred vs x
.
ylimits -0.005 0.003
major ytic mark number 5
.
plot res x
.
ylimits -0.005 0.003
major ytic mark number 5
xlimits 0 3
major xtic mark number 4
xtic offset 0 0
.
plot res pred
.
tic mark label decimals 3
limits -0.004 0.002
tic offset 0.001 0.001
major ytic mark number 4
major xtic mark number 3
.
lag plot res
.
tic mark label decimals
tic offset 0 0
limits
major ytic mark number 6
major xtic mark number 3
xlimits -0.01 0.01
.
histogram res
.
ylimits -0.005 0.003
major ytic mark number 5
xlimits -3 3
xtic offset 0.5 0.5
major xtic mark number 7
.
norm prob plot res
.
end of multiplot
.
justification center
height 4
move 50 96
text 6-plot (PONTIUS.DAT)
.
BOX 0 0 100 100
DEVICE 2 CLOSE
system mv dppl1f.dat 6plot.ps
QUIT
